1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,020
This bunker has room

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,580
for 100,000 people.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,260
100,000 beds,

4
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,380
and every single one

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,330
is empty.

6
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:08,530
The blast door won't seal

7
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,980
until it's full.

8
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,730
So who sleeps down here?

9
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:12,580
You.

10
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,560
Everyone who comments

11
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,300
gets a bed,

12
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,480
with their name on the door.

13
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,100
Right now,

14
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,780
there's nobody inside.

15
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,600
At 1,000,

16
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:20,980
the lights come on.

17
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,880
At 10,000,

18
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,380
the air starts flowing.

19
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,680
And at 100,000,

20
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,460
the door seals,

21
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,660
and we wait out

22
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,580
the end of the world.

23
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,520
But there's something

24
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,180
I haven't told you.

25
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:31,680
Bed 404

26
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,280
was already locked

27
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:33,960
from the inside

28
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:36,080
when we dug it out.

29
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:36,640
Pick your spot

30
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,380
in the comments.

31
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,500
By the garden,

32
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,660
next to the armory,

33
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:42,320
or right beside 404.

34
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,420
Follow me,

35
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,280
and get inside

36
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,400
before the door closes.
